Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They totally won that round!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've been Bucksnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured Sol Ream would whip out\Na teleportation circle, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is my second time as a\Npilfered purveyor of vending goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, things had to\Nturn out this way, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to interrupt, but where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity was in the effect\Nradius and got gotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been through shell and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.73,0:00:51.78,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Potassium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital. O?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we feel like a father's\Ndream in this dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.46,0:01:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.09,0:02:02.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(358,390)\fs15\fscx55)\pos(503,55)}A Stay in Enemy Territory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dungeon stratum houses the\NNetherlord's base of operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.94,0:02:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Netherlord's around these parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels like I cheat-coded\Nmy way to the final boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been trying to clear this\Nstratum since we made our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're sorely lacking\Nin food and supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's painfully obvious that\Nwe desperately need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretending we were after\Npity was an elaborate ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, you're the one we've\Nbeen waiting for this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bycatch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize it's useless to haggle with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so just be a sport and agree to\Ngo exploring with us. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure I can't tempt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.52,0:02:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the whole cursed kid\Nsitch is a heavy load to bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I refuse to plop out a cold\Ncan of betrayal for my pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I had a feeling you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to team up with the fools again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:02:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm already helping Heavy\Nand all of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I agree to grant you any\Nwish a little clan could want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such as reclaiming the heart\Nof the man you loved and lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he's missing are\Nhorns and a pitchfork!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is something I've\Ngot to do on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way to bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the answer's no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her defense is OP!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And her heart is clearly\Ntoo pure for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why must I be so stubborn\Nabout anything love-related?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily for you, I'm a patient man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you out,\Nnot until you agree to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the goods, Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a mad craving for\Nthat fried meat of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may suck, but\Nthey're still customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just giving in sounds hella lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea of replacing the\Nfizzy - Wait, you put her on that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know you've got meats\Nand sweets in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I knew you\Nwouldn't do us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I should order first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those prices!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's ten times as much as usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Booyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us humble vending machines always\Ncharge more at destination spots,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like enemy lairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's extortion or blackmail or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna pay, but I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. Emergency. No toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Pa-Octa-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pity, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're really the best and so kind to me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's time to rise and\Nshine are you kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me with this what's wrong did something
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bad happen oh my goodness wow how lovely
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a shame i'll have to leave one day\Nyou're not taking this whole prisoner
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing seriously prison schmizzen it's My\Nduty as a vending machine to dispense joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you both reconsidered my offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't exactly sound like a chipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, so I guess that\Nmeans I should take it as a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, must we play these silly games?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize I'm giving you\Nthe good cop treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get that from\NSulream, the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll just be a pile\Nof parts and clan chowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say you probably have one week max
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one week left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let it slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he was trying to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within one week?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.34,0:06:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need another hint of food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.93,0:06:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This broke is a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have some mercy, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just sad. You want Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to destroy myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be hard to get good grub around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, if we be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best magic item ever, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really love our old buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that sounds hard\Nto believe, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love you guys like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's breaking our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Shiro's a clingy drunk and\NAkka's a weepy drunk. Pretty cringe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:07:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see what kind\Nof deets they let slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got more to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're these stupid five-finger generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those assholes think\Nthey're so fucking special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freeze, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm complaining,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I haven't seen the nether lord\Nor most of the generals in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pinky finger along\Nwith the index finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the thumb finger are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what those jerks are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We captured the Pinky General\Nin the Dark Forest Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet Solream's the Ring-Fingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Index and the Thumb\NGenerals are M .I .A.,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Middle Fingy's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In-E!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a ton of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make it worse, their\Ngrunts are all Skeletons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's creepy as heck around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many, I'd say there's\Nat least a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Skellingtons won't even\Nmake polite conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so rude and majorly\Nhurts my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and they've got human jerks, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wearing these creepy coats\Nthat aren't even a little cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know if they're\Nhumans or just look like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of want one of those coats, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're asleep, and they\Nleft the door wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't do at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll discuss your drinking problem later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Sulream would like to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accompany me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid pity must stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your backs into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hummus must be even\Nstronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't Boxo heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the build for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could transform into my cardboard\Nself, but that would be far less amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You reap what you sow, kiddos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Sulream, we brought\Nyou Boxxo as requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now leave that thing here\Nand get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stay on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, I hear you're a sapient magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may despise humans, but I'm\Nfine with sentient conveniences.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I'll still destroy\Nyou if you seek to oppose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the captain's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the big bummer\Nabout the blessing of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decay was that it only\Nstops if she's near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, your hair's sopping\Nwet and dripping everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come let me try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for pushing you so hard earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a scratch on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I do a good job\Npretending to be tortured?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.07,0:09:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a talented little actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning the munchkin went method\Nand had us totally marking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, be careful\Nnot to wander too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to keep your\Nnegative blessing at bay if you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise. I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like watching a\Nfamily from an old sitcom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the talking box thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to\Nsee it, and so here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it actually a real person?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And doesn't that mean we're not supposed\Nto let it see us stop pretending?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has a rather limited vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's no one here it\Ncan speak to telepathically.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it really talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it would be okay\Nif I bought something from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.64,0:10:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy whatever you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, buy as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is spoiling the kid rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many\Nweird-looking drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eeny, meeny, miny, moe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That expression is all kinds of wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which drink are you gonna get?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'd be happy with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you pick for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already gotten\Neverything I ever dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slee, child!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We call this shiz stranger danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That chick belongs on a registry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This poor kid got curse whammy, then\Nwoke up only to be held hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a Russian novel anime style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why does he seem to respect\Nthat walking after-school special?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Oh! Lifeline!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since snow people are children\Nuntil they suddenly become adults,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe the ick factor is reduced?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not just think that! This is whack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'd love to keep playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I need to take a teensy nap after\Nusing so much stamina on teleportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I haven't fully recovered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, have a nice nap, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I have permission to buy more\Nstuff from Boxo while you're away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be sure to brush your\Nteeth if you have any sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I act that way to fool her, by\Nexaggerating my youthfulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I was deceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I caused my family much suffering,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it weighs on me more\Nthan you could know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world would be much\Nbetter off without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't waste a life they\Nsacrificed so much to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be a disservice to them,\Nand I simply couldn't bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm masquerading as an obedient kid\Nto gather intel on their inner circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the curse, it truly pains\Nme to deceive my own family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my little bros are\Nbad at keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks like a child, but when he speaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's pretty dang clear he's\Nolder than those immature twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you have wondrous powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My parents told me everything\Nabout you and your gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want you to stay here and serve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refusal means destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any means of escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly do anything in my\Npower to help you pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next few days, I spent my\Nmornings vending Pity's breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I was whisked away to\NSolream's pad to then some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After Brekkie, but before\Nlunch, so technically brunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wheeled to a cafeteria\Nwith humans and beast people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I wouldn't\Nsay no to more food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For today, will you stay with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is pity crushing on a\Ncertain vending machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like always, your food is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boxxo. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me thinks that's the first time\Nshe's called me by my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:14:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this that suspension bridge\Neffect thingy from psychology?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When in imminent danger you mistake\Nthe pounding of your heart for lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it's just psychology, Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.57,0:14:11.03,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(479,130)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psychology doesn't lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're properly prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's the big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I almost forgot\Nthat was even happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The catered meeting on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair, Akka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only our Big Bro, Boxo, Pity,\Nand Sulream are invited to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Solream's trying to pass it\Noff as a catered meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's really just a\Nrooftop barbecue party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis, I really, really, really\Nwant to eat outside tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I do it on the roof instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sulream was powerless\Nagainst his S-rank cuteness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even convinced her\Nto invite pity so she
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could use her blessing of\Nweight to get me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect chance\Nto escape their fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:15:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I botch this, it's probably\Ncurtains for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem the middle-fingered\Ngeneral was nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the goons talking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though we've yet to see the\Ngeneral with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The middle thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not knowing what to expect\Nmakes me super nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I must have been blinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be vending, not venting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I think of all the cool\Nstuff Boxo's about to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to ditch the netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same for me! Team Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Team Hunters and Fizzies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please make sure to get a nice\Nrecording of your reunion with Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the only normal one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, no peeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:15:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To business!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These coin lockers preserve freshness,\Nso I'm using them for the big lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.84,0:16:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Petitrusts in Boxo. Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're ready to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.52,0:16:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's allowed on the roof until lunch,\Nso you'll be on your own until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surin's orders were incredibly clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None shall pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Shiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not on our watch,\NAka. That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to\Nfollow the orders given to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still no sign of\Nthe Middlefinger, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, and I've never seen the\NNetherlord here even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not exactly being\Nsubtle, but that's good info.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:16:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.30,0:17:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm literally incapable of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will meet again. Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guests of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you try anything funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll freeze you on the spot\Nand keep you as an ice statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beautimous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She thinks I'm a regular old magic\Nitem, so she's only watchdogging pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try it, big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you already drink from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you wouldn't want\Nit after it's been in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the opposite of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it makes me want it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm. Score!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That yakiniku sauce has her\Nslugging them back like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you're wiggling\Nlike that? It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a little\Nbathroom break. Go time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caffeine has a diuretic effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't chug that much\Nwithout nature calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name's pity, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.22,0:18:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try anything stupid while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trapped on a rooftop\Non an isolated island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun, Kerrioll?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, please hurry! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Balloon vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope this works!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Octae?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I guess that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activating it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity's weight blessing is in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She made me, herself, and her\Nshield light as a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for another form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coin-powered vacuum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bend up some mighty wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, it's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barrier costs a lot of points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've got over a mil!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it ain't no thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just gotta find an island and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, that's right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to be following us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the actual?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's at least 50 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fly no further!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bin is telepathic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must face punishment and for attempting\Nto escape the Netherlord's grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the Middle Finger General,\NI will not abide this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Middlefingy's a shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why he was never at the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take us higher, Balloon Brigade!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Points reduced by 918.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy, happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You yellow-bellied coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you no honor within\Nthat magic box of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's following us! Crossroads!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we try to float away or troll?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ok, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super-sized vending machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,complete with the concrete blocks\Nthose big mamas are bolted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready? Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the freak is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're cucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:20:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remove barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those things appeared as if from nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super-sized Fendi-Machine attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.44,0:21:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fatality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all I got to do is find Pity and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easier done than said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if she adjusted her\Nweight, that was reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Octa-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been pretty heckin' scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.56,0:21:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about the time\NLamas would start yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the general was amphibious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting deja vu from when we\Ndefeated the Netherlord's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he sees the body, he'll\Nknow this was a Boxxo joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping the fishies have\Nthemselves a middle thingy feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.09,0:23:40.13,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.09,0:23:40.13,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs17.4\fsp3\pos(246.2,295.8)}The Troubles Will Continue Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

